{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id628762208"}, "name":{"label":"ghjkkhfr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-13T03:06:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.27"}, "id":{"label":"11487854716"}, "title":{"label":"Should have stayed at a 5 star hotels"}, "content":{"label":"There is no benefit to staying with airbnb: the price is not cheaper than a 5 star hotel, the house is old and shabby, the cleaning fee is expensive and they also make guests pay extra for trash disposal after check-out.\nWe stayed 3 nights in Sydney (200$/night) and paid 83$ for “cleaning fee“ at the beginning. But after check-out they asked 30$ more for throwing trash which is ridiculous! And the trash were just tissues to dry our hands after each wash, not anything gross!! Never staying with Airbnb again!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
