{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id300131518"}, "name":{"label":"P4nh.oe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-08-27T06:21:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.34"}, "id":{"label":"10304847117"}, "title":{"label":"About accomodation"}, "content":{"label":"Dear Airbnb team, First of all, I would like to thank you for providing professional and convenient accommodation services to customers all over the world. Recently, I have rented some houses through your company and I find that Airbnb needs to have criteria for accepting rental houses. The criteria must be suitable for each location and the corresponding rental price and service. For example: hot areas with temperatures up to 35°C need air conditioning and well-ventilated fans. Living conditions: the bedroom must have essential items such as beds, bed sheets, pillows, guaranteed temperature and air quality for respiration. The kitchen area must have kitchen utensils for eating and drinking. Cooking utensils must be available. We just spent two nights at 1201 Chemin des Poissonniers Lot jardin lumière, La Ciotat, Provence-Alpes-Côte d’Azur 13600. The house is missing many items, the bed has no bed sheets (the picture on Airbnb has) and pillowcases. The kitchen has no kettle, no hairdryer, no bath towels. The host said that they do not offer bath towels and bed sheets but also did not mention it in the “not available” section. The host also asked us to take out the trash while the cleaning fee was already charged at 87.12 USD. I think in addition to charging fees, Airbnb needs to be responsible for customers, ensuring customers have the necessary and sufficient conditions for their stay.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
